BOSS Colossus Phase 2B Golems Spawn
    Events
        Time - Every 50.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        (BossColossus is alive) Equal to True
        BossColossusBoulders Equal to False
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Colossus Phase 2A Boulders Q <gen>
        -------- Set boolean for the action --------
        Set VariableSet BossColossusGolems = True
        -------- ========== Transition to phase golems --------
        -------- Colossus wil move the original center location (blight area) --------
        Unit - Make BossColossus Invulnerable
        Set VariableSet BossColossusTempPoint = (Center of ColossusSpot <gen>)
        Unit - Order BossColossus to Move To BossColossusTempPoint
        Sound - Play ColossusMove <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to BossColossus
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossusTempPoint)
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Phase 2B Golems Spawn Q <gen>
